 A. Provide the exact value of angle A in degrees or radians.", 'gen_ai.response.id': 'cc0ea27f-a9b8-4bab-a21c-34e024841da2', 'gen_ai.response.model': 'deepseek-v4-flash', 'gen_ai.openai.system_fingerprint': 'a26a7955944dc5c60445bff77fac9c8e', 'gen_ai.usage.total_tokens': 650, 'gen_ai.usage.prompt_tokens': 122, 'gen_ai.usage.completion_tokens': 528, 'gen_ai.completion.0.finish_reason': 'stop', 'gen_ai.completion.0.role': 'assistant', 'gen_ai.completion.0.content': "We are given:  \n- Circumradius \\( R = 13 \\)  \n- Inradius \\( r = 6 \\)  \n- \\( IA \\perp OI \\)  \n\n**Step 1: Euler's formula**  \n\\[\nOI^2 = R^2 - 2Rr = 13^2 - 2(13)(6) = 169 - 156 = 13\n\\]  \nSo  \n\\[\nOI = \\sqrt{13}.\n\\]\n\n**Step 2: Known formula for \\( IA \\)**  \nThe distance from incenter \\( I \\) to vertex \\( A \\) is  \n\\[\nIA = \\frac{r}{\\sin(A/2)}.\n\\]\n\n**Step 3: Condition \\( IA \\perp OI \\)**  \nIf \\( IA \\perp OI \\), then triangle \\( AIO \\) is right-angled at \\( I \\).  \nThus, by Pythagoras:  \n\\[\nAO^2 = AI^2 + OI^2.\n\\]  \nBut \\( AO = R = 13 \\), so:  \n\\[\n13^2 = \\left( \\frac{r}{\\sin(A/2)} \\right)^2 + (\\sqrt{13})^2.\n\\]  \nThat is:  \n\\[\n169 = \\frac{36}{\\sin^2(A/2)} + 13.\n\\]\n\n**Step 4: Solve for \\(\\sin(A/2)\\)**  \n\\[\n169 - 13 = \\frac{36}{\\sin^2(A/2)}\n\\]  \n\\[\n156 = \\frac{36}{\\sin^2(A/2)}\n\\]  \n\\[\n\\sin^2(A/2) = \\frac{36}{156} = \\frac{3}{13}.\n\\]  \nThus  \n\\[\n\\sin(A/2) = \\sqrt{\\frac{3}{13}}.\n\\]\n\n**Step 5: Find \\( A \\)**  \n\\[\nA/2 = \\arcsin\\left( \\sqrt{\\frac{3}{13}} \\right)\n\\]  \nSo  \n\\[\nA = 2 \\arcsin\\left( \\sqrt{\\frac{3}{13}} \\right).\n\\]\n\nThis is the exact value in radians. In degrees, it's approximately:  \n\\[\n\\sqrt{3/13} \\approx 0.480384, \\quad \\arcsin \\approx 28.685^\\circ, \\quad A \\approx 57.37^\\circ.\n\\]\n\n**Final exact answer:**  \n\\[\n\\boxed{2 \\arcsin\\left( \\sqrt{\\frac{3}{13}} \\right)}\n\\]"}, 'events': [], 'links': [], 'resource': {'attributes': {'service.name': 'agen