 response must end with the Context, Sub-Goal, and Tool Name sections in that order, with no extra content.\n                    ', 'gen_ai.response.id': 'chatcmpl-ef9820dbfaa341ceb1b55e51c8293660', 'gen_ai.response.model': 'models/Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct', 'gen_ai.usage.total_tokens': 1174, 'gen_ai.usage.prompt_tokens': 1024, 'gen_ai.usage.completion_tokens': 150, 'gen_ai.completion.0.finish_reason': 'stop', 'gen_ai.completion.0.role': 'assistant', 'gen_ai.completion.0.content': '**Justification:**  \nThe query is a system of logarithmic equations, and it is most efficiently solved by a tool that can handle algebraic manipulations and equation solving. The Generalist_Solution_Generator_Tool is the best choice for this task as it can provide a step-by-step solution to the mathematical problem.\n\n**Context:**  \nThe system of equations given is:\n\\[\n\\log_x(y^x) = 10, \\quad \\log_y(x^{4y}) = 10.\n\\]\n\n**Sub-Goal:**  \nSolve the system of equations to find \\(x\\) and \\(y\\) such that both logarithmic expressions equal 10.\n\n**Tool Name:** Generalist_Solution_Generator_Tool', 'prompt_token_ids': [151644, 8948, 198, 2610, 525, 264, 10950, 11, 11521, 11, 323, 7785, 17847, 13, 151645, 198, 151644, 872, 271, 6262, 25, 29901, 279, 22823, 1790, 3019, 311, 2621, 279, 3239, 1667, 2500, 7375, 323, 3681, 7354, 382, 1972, 510, 12, 3070, 2859, 66963, 2619, 3000, 1931, 5109, 400, 87, 3, 323, 400, 88, 54876, 2176, 7046, 1091, 220, 16, 11, 1741, 429, 57960, 839, 3212, 59, 2359, 7021, 61, 87, 59, 1291, 11730, 59, 839, 4178, 59, 2359, 2075, 47822, 19, 88, 11035, 1291, 11730, 16, 15, 12947, 7379, 400, 4130, 3, 382, 4498, 5527, 11, 2550, 279, 1590, 4226, 43810, 304, 366, 9217, 29, 323, 690, 9217, 29, 9492, 13, 3155, 537, 6923, 894, 2213, 1283, 279, 690, 9217, 29, 4772, 13, 3197, 5527, 11, 2550, 279, 1590, 4226, 43810, 304, 366, 9217, 29, 323, 690, 9217, 29, 9492, 13, 3155, 537, 6923, 894, 2213, 1283, 279, 690, 9217, 29, 4772, 624, 12, 3070, 2859, 18320, 66963, 366, 9217, 397, 334, 1